  "reason": "Near-term fundamentals are deteriorating: core EDA market share fell, FCF conversion weakened on rising receivables, Q3 revenue growth decelerated sharply, margins compressed, and Q4 guidance was 5% below consensus. The positive FCF and solver breakthrough are offset by these competitive and operational headwinds, supporting a sell."
